WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.723
The evaluation is deliberately broad,

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:07.526
spanning thirteen benchmarks and two mainstream tasks.

00:00:07.606 --> 00:00:11.329
For forecasting there are the four ETT subsets,
plus Weather, Electricity, Traffic,

00:00:11.409 --> 00:00:15.132
and Exchange.

00:00:15.212 --> 00:00:18.935
For classification there are two EEG datasets, AD
and TDBrain, and an ECG dataset,

00:00:19.015 --> 00:00:22.738
PTB.

00:00:22.818 --> 00:00:26.542
On top of these eleven established benchmarks,

00:00:26.622 --> 00:00:30.345
the authors construct two new large-scale,

00:00:30.425 --> 00:00:34.148
multi-domain datasets called TSLD-500M and TSLD-1G.

00:00:34.228 --> 00:00:37.951
The larger one packs nearly fourteen million
examples drawn from diverse,

00:00:38.031 --> 00:00:41.754
non-overlapping domains,

00:00:41.834 --> 00:00:45.557
which lets the paper stress-test cross-domain
transfer where pre-training and fine-tuning

00:00:45.637 --> 00:00:49.360
data come from entirely different sources.
